Package: henge-guest
Version: 1.2.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Henge <henge@localhost>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, util-linux, cloud-guest-utils, gdisk, e2fsprogs, davfs2
Recommends: wl-clipboard, xclip, python3
Description: Henge guest tools
 Grows the root partition and file system to the disk on every boot,
 does the one-time first-boot setup, mounts the shared folder at ~/Henge and
 shares the clipboard with the device on the desktop.
